  "changes": [
    "Commerce reports, names and mappings share one source bundle; imports and archive requests use one abortable operation owner. In-memory report drafts restore across workbench navigation and are isolated by account, role, domain, organization and store.",
    "Organization settings, branch connection, audit export, dashboard reads and joining use shared request ownership and explicit response checks. Failed reads remain errors with retry, fields retain drafts after failure, and obsolete responses cannot commit into another scope.",
